{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file contains the implementation of the event loop integration for the libwebsockets library using the GLib event system. It includes functions to initialize, manage, and destroy GLib-based event sources, timers, and signal handlers, specifically tailored for use within the libwebsockets architecture. It also defines operations for handling IO events, timers, and WSI (WebSocket Instance) lifecycle management in a GLib environment.", "external_files": ["private-lib-core.h", "private-lib-event-libs-glib.h", "<glib-unix.h>"], "external_methods": ["g_main_loop_new", "g_main_loop_run", "g_source_new", "g_source_set_callback", "g_source_attach", "g_source_destroy", "g_source_unref", "g_source_add_unix_fd", "g_source_modify_unix_fd", "g_source_remove_unix_fd", "g_main_loop_quit", "g_main_loop_unref", "g_unix_signal_add", "g_main_context_get_context"], "published": ["evlib_glib", "elops_init_context_glib", "elops_accept_glib", "elops_listen_init_glib", "elops_init_pt_glib", "elops_io_glib", "elops_run_pt_glib", "elops_destroy_wsi_glib", "elops_listen_destroy_glib", "elops_destroy_pt_glib", "elops_destroy_context2_glib", "elops_wsi_logical_close_glib", "lws_glib_sigint_cb", "lws_glib_idle_timer_cb", "lws_glib_hrtimer_cb", "lws_glib_check"], "classes": [{"name": "struct lws_io_watcher_glib_subclass", "description": "Represents a subclassed GSource for attaching IO events to the GLib main loop, encapsulating the wsi (WebSocket instance) and its associated socket file descriptor."}, {"name": "struct lws_pt_eventlibs_glib", "description": "Holds the GLib-specific data for a libwebsockets per-thread context, including the main loop, timers, and signal handlers."}, {"name": "struct lws_wsi_eventlibs_glib", "description": "Contains per-WSI data specific to the GLib event implementation, such as the read source."}], "methods": [{"name": "gboolean lws_glib_idle_timer_cb(void * p)", "description": "Callback triggered for idle events to service pending operations and maintain timers within the GLib event loop.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "gboolean lws_glib_hrtimer_cb(void * p)", "description": "Handles high-resolution timer callbacks to process scheduled events and reset timers accordingly.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "gboolean lws_glib_check(GSource * src)", "description": "Checks the query result of a Unix file descriptor source to determine if events are pending.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int elops_init_context_glib(struct lws_context * context,const struct lws_context_creation_info * info)", "description": "Initializes the GLib-specific parts of the libwebsockets context, including setting signal callbacks.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int elops_accept_glib(struct lws * wsi)", "description": "Sets up a GLib GSource to monitor and handle a new WebSocket connection.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int elops_listen_init_glib(struct lws_dll2 * d,void * user)", "description": "Initializes listening sockets with GLib event sources.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int elops_init_pt_glib(struct lws_context * context,void * _loop,int tsi)", "description": "Initializes a per-thread context with a GLib main loop, attaching signal handlers and setting up event sources.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void elops_io_glib(struct lws * wsi,unsigned int flags)", "description": "Modifies the GLib source that monitors a socket to enable or disable reading/writing events.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void elops_run_pt_glib(struct lws_context * context,int tsi)", "description": "Runs the GLib main loop for a given thread context.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void elops_destroy_wsi_glib(struct lws * wsi)", "description": "Removes and frees the GLib event source associated with a WebSocket instance.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int elops_listen_destroy_glib(struct lws_dll2 